	)
	(text "Bring-up test points — scope probes with a ground spring"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 280.67 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2008ea49-e5b5-5f8b-8d84-d8c5a736e123")
	)
	(text "VDRAIN: 10 Ω + 10 µF (≈ 4 µF at 48 V → τ ≈ 40 µs) keeps the slew under the 2 V/µs abs max on hot-plug.\nVDRAIN also carries the charge-pump current (1.9 mA + 3·Qg·f ≈ 9 mA @ 30 kHz, 16 mA @ 60 kHz) → drop ≤ 0.16 V;\nsubtract it from the high-side VDS_LVL. VM: 10 Ω + 10 µF filter (~25–35 mA → ≤ 0.35 V), 9–75 V operating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04731213-939a-5a16-8e08-42dc01cf9833")
	)
	(text "LM5008A design (VIN 10–52 V, VOUT ≈ 5.0 V, ≤ 250 mA):\n• RT = 200k → Ton = 0.53 µs @ 52 V (> 400 ns min), f ≈ 5 V / (1.385e-10 × RT) ≈ 180 kHz\n• L = 100 µH, 1 A sat: ΔI = 0.14 A @ 10 V … 0.25 A @ 52 V; guaranteed load ≈ 0.25 A (I_LIM min 0.41 A)\n• FB node = 2.5 × (4.7k + 4.7k)/4.7k = 5.0 V; R = 1 Ω gives FB ripple 70–125 mV (≥ 25 mV needed)\n  and +5V = 5.0 − 1 Ω × I_load (≈ 4.8 V @ 200 mA; ≤ 5.4 V worst case at light load)\n• RCL = 150k → T_off ≈ 3.4 µs in overload; 35 µs in short circuit\n• D = MBR1H100SFT3G (100 V, 1 A, 0.76 V, SOD-123FL: the buck pins need the room an SMA took)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.3 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44f96ad3-2309-5060-ae58-a94e8f1802a5")
	)
	(text "SPI: mode 1, ≤ 10 MHz (MT6835 shares SCK/MOSI/MISO in mode 3; the ISR owns SPI1).\nSDO pull-up 1.5k (~25 ns at 15 pF); run DRV transactions ≤ 4 MHz, then restore CPOL = 1 for the MT6835.\n6×PWM mode (PWM_MODE = 00b). INHx/INLx have internal pull-downs.\nCSA gain per motor profile over SPI: ×40 gimbal (±35 A), ×10 QDD (±140 A, 1 mΩ).\nCSA offset ±3 mV max → calibrate (CAL bits) at every enable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "669e009c-f4a6-564c-b102-adc2c7954e3c")
	)
